      "message": "[warning] Line 1445: 🟡 `get_directory_property(... DEFINITION CONTRIB_PATH)` is used without validating the result before the `EXISTS \"${_daemon_contrib_path}/lib/...\"` checks. If `CONTRIB_PATH` is unset/empty in a given configuration, this can degrade to probing `/lib/libssl.a` and `/lib/libcrypto.a` (or another unintended path), causing non-deterministic linking against system archives. Add an explicit guard such as `if(_daemon_contrib_path AND NOT _daemon_contrib_path MATCHES \"-NOTFOUND$\" AND EXISTS ...)` before using it.",
